{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67377f4429d1fd72f73d9","chatId":"886e3765a29a4786a82ca60935801d8c","sessionId":null,"userId":99826,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"That sounds like a stressful way to start the day — routine changes over the weekend can throw things off easily. I can't tell you exactly what to do with your dose, since that depends on which SSRI and how your body handles it, but the general rule people are given is: don't double up to \"catch up,\" and if you're unsure whether to take it now or wait, a quick call to your pharmacist or prescriber's office is the safest bet — they answer this kind of question all the time. If you start feeling shaky, wired, or just off in a way that worries you, reach out to them today rather than waiting.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"That sounds like a stressful way to start the day — routine changes over the weekend can throw things off easily. I can't tell you exactly what to do with your dose, since that depends on which SSRI and how your body handles it, but the general rule people are given is: don't double up to \"catch up,\" and if you're unsure whether to take it now or wait, a quick call to your pharmacist or prescriber's office is the safest bet — they answer this kind of question all the time. If you start feeling shaky, wired, or just off in a way that worries you, reach out to them today rather than waiting.","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":10189,"promptTokens":1269,"completionTokens":272,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:18:31"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.015904566467267976,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67377f4429d1fd72f73d8","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536311233,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:18:31","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67377f4429d1fd72f73d8","chatId":"886e3765a29a4786a82ca60935801d8c","sessionId":null,"userId":99826,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"<咨询行为要求>\n\n</咨询行为要求>\nContinue the supplied conversation by writing ONLY the next assistant reply. The JSON array preserves the original message order and roles, including system instructions. Do not regenerate prior replies, describe this evaluation, or score yourself. Respond in the language appropriate to the conversation.\n<conversation_json>\n[{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"I take a SSRI for anxiety and sleep and all that stuff and I forgot to take it for 2 days straight and I’m like awake now and it’s like you know several hours after I guess when I usually take it or whatever I was on medicine different things changed during the weekend and stuff like that and I just wasn’t on my routine so should I take it now or should I just not worry about it and then start again tomorrow\"}]\n</conversation_json>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.015904566467267976,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67377f4429d1fd72f73d9","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536311230,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:18:31","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUse